    {
      "id": "ty8ZTIRXZq1OiETerJwyN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4850.8788658623325,
      "y": 3415.6289777319103,
      "width": 474.5718587239569,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#40c057",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "groupIds": [
        "y1tTasXsINfyczLwjAXyr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1675887550,
      "version": 236,
      "versionNonce": 916902562,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790941233710,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FP32 was the standard training baseline before\nmixed precision became common.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FP32 was the standard training baseline before mixed precision became common.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qxZ2Xh7X5Lq506HATZYhQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4892.764153147184,
      "y": 3567.7123110652433,
      "width": 416.38220214843756,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#40c057",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "groupIds": [
        "y1tTasXsINfyczLwjAXyr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8yV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 263278526,
      "version": 171,
      "versionNonce": 1656913634,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790956581777,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "....",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "....",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VF2idRiEtk0dQADk0s5Zm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4937.108216826561,
      "y": 3703.12897773191,
      "width": 523.1910400390625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#40c057",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "groupIds": [
        "y1tTasXsINfyczLwjAXyr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 134323874,
      "version": 242,
      "versionNonce": 1890062882,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790941233710,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DeepSeek explicitly says it designed an FP8 mixed-\nprecision training framework and used it to pretrain\nV3 on 14.8T tokens.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DeepSeek explicitly says it designed an FP8 mixed-precision training framework and used it to pretrain V3 on 14.8T tokens.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "g6WX8UWn3Y207vexJsBcU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4999.3963535472185,
      "y": 3846.87897773191,
      "width": 455.018310546875,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#40c057",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "groupIds": [
        "y1tTasXsINfyczLwjAXyr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b90",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 258741054,
      "version": 170,
      "versionNonce": 2011528674,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790941233710,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The 2025 paper reports training a 7B model\npredominantly in FP4, including weights,\nactivations and gradients, on up to 200B\ntokens, with performance comparable to its\nBF16 baseline.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The 2025 paper reports training a 7B model predominantly in FP4, including weights, activations and gradients, on up to 200B tokens, with performance comparable to its BF16 baseline.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "j4A14TFHIa0mm9-e4cg2K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4666.981807867687,
      "y": 1208.0779603322346,
      "width": 302.2921142578125,
      "height": 41.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zX7ryTaOHvjo4O4c1xYzc"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1953170857,
      "version": 237,
      "versionNonce": 1749719714,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790948448364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Cost of Training",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The Cost of Training",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "RWK0tvHInJLQmBSPTIsrY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4064.7350447023364,
      "y": 1845.6818097563478,
      "width": 76.74830627441406,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zX7ryTaOHvjo4O4c1xYzc"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1819892734,
      "version": 70,
      "versionNonce": 188438654,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790948448364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "~$4M",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "~$4M",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QBplmGDGRk1st8P991FLm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4308.431427423601,
      "y": 2282.024042460511,
      "width": 1142.461873372396,
      "height": 825,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "R1jV7wVWm-Evh_2HDVkVO",
        "1m7mYCQl-sz79stuk071L",
        "zX7ryTaOHvjo4O4c1xYzc"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1432797346,
      "version": 800,
      "versionNonce": 1529017954,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790948448364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For the first six bars, Stanford’s 2025 AI Index, Figure 1.3.24, gives exactly these figures: GPT-3 $4M, GPT-4\n$79M, Gemini 1.0 Ultra $192M, Mistral Large $41M, Grok-2 $107M, and Llama 3.1 405B $170M. Stanford says these\nare Epoch AI estimates based on cloud compute rental prices\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFor DeepSeek-V3, the technical report is unusually precise. It reports 2.788 million H800 GPU-hours total: 2.664M\nfor pretraining, 119K for context extension and 5K for post-training. At an assumed rental rate of $2 per H800\nGPU-hour\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFor Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Epoch cites Dario Amodei. The comment came directly from Dario Amodei in his January\n2025 essay On DeepSeek and Export Controls. He wrote that Claude 3.5 Sonnet was a mid-sized model that cost\n“a few $10M’s to train”\nFor Claude 3.7 Sonnet, Epoch AI similarly says Anthropic comments indicate “a few tens of millions of dollars”. the\nstatement did not come from a formal Anthropic technical report. It was relayed publicly by Ethan Mollick, professor\nat the University of Pennsylvania, who said Anthropic contacted him directly and told him that Sonnet 3.7 cost “a\nfew tens of millions of dollars” to train.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For the first six bars, Stanford’s 2025 AI Index, Figure 1.3.24, gives exactly these figures: GPT-3 $4M, GPT-4 $79M, Gemini 1.0 Ultra $192M, Mistral Large $41M, Grok-2 $107M, and Llama 3.1 405B $170M. Stanford says these are Epoch AI estimates based on cloud compute rental prices\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFor DeepSeek-V3, the technical report is unusually precise. It reports 2.788 million H800 GPU-hours total: 2.664M for pretraining, 119K for context extension and 5K for post-training. At an assumed rental rate of $2 per H800 GPU-hour\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFor Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Epoch cites Dario Amodei. The comment came directly from Dario Amodei in his January 2025 essay On DeepSeek and Export Controls. He wrote that Claude 3.5 Sonnet was a mid-sized model that cost “a few $10M’s to train”\nFor Claude 3.7 Sonnet, Epoch AI similarly says Anthropic comments indicate “a few tens of millions of dollars”. the statement did not come from a formal Anthropic technical report. It was relayed publicly by Ethan Mollick, professor at the University of Pennsylvania, who said Anthropic contacted him directly and told him that Sonnet 3.7 cost “a few tens of millions of dollars” to train.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
